The fantasy island
An island where mythical and ancient creatures reside, Fantasy Island is a place where you can fight powerful and mighty creatures, and earn money and items by killing them. The island contains three maps, in which various creatures can be found, and one map which is a challenge, by crossing which you can gain the ultimate griffin.
Accessed from evermore city's beach, by entering in to the path to Fantasy Island. Also can be accessed by using a fantasy pass, however that requires your level to be above 75.
Noteworthy items which can be gained here are health boosters, as well as fantasy pass, and most importantly the ultimate griffin, a magical half bird on which you can fly.
Total maps four, the list being as follows
Land of the fallen, the first map of the island. Creatures like Godzilla and mammoth can be found here. Overall they give good xp, good items, as well as good money
Sky of the mighty, second map of the island, is accessed from climbing the mountain. Some of the creatures here are ancient dragons, phoenix, megadragons, wyverns, as well as griffins. It is a map where you can earn health boosters as well as fantasy pass
Path to griffins lair. The third map inside the island, it is accessed by pressing shift enter on statue located on the island. As soon as you activate the statue you are teleported in the middle of the clouds, where you have to find your way forward. This map is different as compared to the other challenges, as the platforms you need to find have no sound at all. When you reach its end heal your health, then press shift enter. You'll be moved to the griffins lair, where the ultimate griffin will be waiting for you. If you can manage to kill it you will gain an ultimate griffin.
Sea of the forgotten, the last map of the island, it is an ocean. To fight the creatures here you have to swim underwater. Beware that without gas masks and air canisters you should not enter this map, as without them you will suffocate due to the lack of air underwater.